# Figma is the source of truth

Before changing layout, type, color, spacing, or images:

1. Load the Figma design-to-code skill.
2. Read the relevant frame(s) and variable definitions from the live file.
3. Use those values. Do not substitute nearby Tailwind defaults.

File: [Affordable Bellbottom Pier Drilling](https://www.figma.com/design/rNBkruQcCGz3s7uz1xn0bR/Affordable-Bellbottom-Pier-Drilling)

